# command-injection-audit Rule

When auditing command injection:
1. Follow `.agents/skills/command-injection-audit/references/cmdi_checklist.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/command-injection-audit/SKILL.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first, then `scripts/cmdi_probe.py` (split-marker and arithmetic only). Use `scripts/sink_scan.py` for source review.
4. Timing probes need approval. Environment-variable and interpreter tricks are authorized-only and are not run by this skill.
